---
source: src/completion/engine.rs
expression: "output.join(\"\\n\")"
---
tool	All 3 checks in this section	this tool	space
tool.config	Host configuration parses	this tool	space
tool.binary	Installed binary is root-owned	this tool	space
tool.completion	Shell completion is current	this tool	space
hw	All 9 checks in this section	hardware	space
hw.usb	Exactly one matching USB UPS	hardware	space
hw.data	UPS data is fresh	hardware	space
hw.online	UPS is safely on line	hardware	space
hw.delays	Shutdown and start delays match the profile	hardware	space
hw.shutdown-return	shutdown.return is advertised	hardware	space
hw.rb	Replace-battery flag is clear	hardware	space
hw.charge	Battery charge is at least 90%	hardware	space
hw.battery-age	Battery age versus install date	hardware	space
hw.self-test	Last UPS self-test	hardware	space
svc	All 8 checks in this section	services	space
svc.driver	NUT driver is active	services	space
svc.server	NUT server is active	services	space
svc.monitor	NUT monitor is active	services	space
svc.enabled	NUT units are enabled	services	space
svc.restarts	Driver NRestarts are stable	services	space
svc.listen	upsd listens only on loopback	services	space
svc.client	A loopback monitor client is logged in	services	space
svc.version	NUT version policy	services	space
protect	All 6 checks in this section	protection	space
protect.runtime	Early shutdown fits remaining runtime	protection	space
protect.poweroff-wait	POWEROFF_WAIT headroom	protection	space
protect.hook	Event hook is installed	protection	space
protect.mail	Mail path exists	protection	space
protect.pwrstatd	PowerPanel is not running	protection	space
protect.killpower	No stale /etc/killpower	protection	space
root	All 7 checks in this section	root-only	space
root.drift	Rendered files match live NUT config	root-only	space
root.credentials	upsd and upsmon credentials agree	root-only	space
root.placeholders	No password placeholders remain	root-only	space
root.instcmds	No instcmds = ALL grant	root-only	space
root.perms	NUT file owners and modes	root-only	space
state.drift	Applied state matches managed files	root-only	space
state.backup	Applied-state backup is available	root-only	space
boot	All 8 checks in this section	boot & BIOS	space
boot.efi-order	EFI boot order starts with Linux	boot & BIOS	space
boot.nofail	Listed mounts have nofail	boot & BIOS	space
boot.fstab	findmnt --verify is clean	boot & BIOS	space
boot.journal	journald is persistent	boot & BIOS	space
boot.panic	kernel.panic is set	boot & BIOS	space
boot.watchdog	Watchdog is available	boot & BIOS	space
bios.profile	Board profile matches DMI	boot & BIOS	space
bios.attest	BIOS attestation freshness	boot & BIOS	space
proof	All 4 checks in this section	proof	space
proof.blip	Mains blip drill	proof	space
proof.ac-loss	True AC-loss drill	proof	space
proof.cycle	UPS cycle drill	proof	space
proof.outage	Sustained outage drill	proof	space
